import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 368 | Dou Continent · Retcon-Ending Deep Analysis: Late Setting Overturning Early","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 368 | Dou Continent · Retcon-Ending Deep Analysis: Late Setting Overturning Early","no":368,"module":2,"tags":["Dou Continent","Retcon Ending","Late Overturning Early","Setting Collapse","Law-First"],"related":["97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","89-Time-Paradox Prevention Mechanism","09-Reality-as-Basis Fundamental Stance"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0368_模块2-斗罗-吃书烂尾深度分析-后期设定推翻前期.md","filePath":"en/0368_模块2-斗罗-吃书烂尾深度分析-后期设定推翻前期.md"}'),a={name:"en/0368_模块2-斗罗-吃书烂尾深度分析-后期设定推翻前期.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,c,d){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-368-dou-continent-·-retcon-ending-deep-analysis-late-setting-overturning-early" tabindex="-1">Entry 368 | Dou Continent · Retcon-Ending Deep Analysis: Late Setting Overturning Early <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-368-dou-continent-·-retcon-ending-deep-analysis-late-setting-overturning-early" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 368 | Dou Continent · Retcon-Ending Deep Analysis: Late Setting Overturning Early&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Dou Continent System Decomposition (Entry 9) | Benchmark base: Documents 97, 89, 09</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-rules-set-early-personally-torn-up-late" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Rules set early, personally torn up late <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-rules-set-early-personally-torn-up-late" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Rules set early, personally torn up late&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dou Continent is a model negative textbook of the law-first axiom. Early iron laws — century rings already scarce, Soul Master breakthrough must hunt, Title Douluo rare under heaven — were the pillars supporting the whole book&#39;s credibility. Late, to let Tang San keep climbing, these pillars are pulled out one by one: hundred-thousand-year rings mass-produced, spirit souls kill-free, Extreme Douluo everywhere, divine ranks layered. Readers are not &quot;accepting an upgrade,&quot; but &quot;forgiving a retcon.&quot; This entry, taking the law-first axiom as core, does a deep dissection of retcon-ending. Protagonist uniqueness dependency: <strong>high (gift-style leaning oligarchic)</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Early effort voided</strong>: the hard-won breakthroughs the protagonist struggled for early are outdone late by casually obtained stronger resources; effort&#39;s narrative value hollowed out</li><li><strong>Setting-credit loss</strong>: every overturned early iron law subtracts a point of readers&#39; trust in the worldview</li><li><strong>Foreshadowing abandoned</strong>: rule suspense planted early cannot be retrieved late due to setting changes</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Retcon-ending&#39;s blow to &quot;civilizational credibility&quot; is structural:</p><ol><li><strong>Rules fickle</strong>: when rules can be overturned by plot, all beings cannot plan their fate by rules; civilization expectation collapses</li><li><strong>Experience devalued</strong>: previous generations&#39; cultivation experience voided by rule changes; knowledge cannot accumulate</li><li><strong>Authority arbitrary</strong>: the relation between strong ones and rules becomes &quot;strong ones say change, it changes&quot;; Myriad Ranks lose a law to rely on</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Rules for my use</strong>: wherever Tang San walks, rules make way there — he does not climb within rules, but makes rules change around him</li><li><strong>Interpretation monopoly</strong>: ultimately only Tang San and his Divine Realm have the right to announce &quot;the rules are actually like this&quot;; all beings can only accept</li><li><strong>Destruction = leveling</strong>: every retcon is accompanied by a protagonist leap; the benefit of rule-breaking is enjoyed solely by the protagonist</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dou Retcon-Ending</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Early iron laws overturned late</td><td>Law precedes, never retcons; setting-contradiction self-check table periodically audited</td></tr><tr><td>Rules change with plot</td><td>Setting self-consistency over plot convenience; plot must not kidnap setting</td></tr><tr><td>Protagonist monopolizes interpretation</td><td>Anchor Council legislates, Symbiotic Court adjudicates; interpretation public</td></tr><tr><td>Foreshadowing abandoned</td><td>New dimensions all appendix-caliber incremental joins, not overturning old setting</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The alternative&#39;s crux: Heng Yuan Zhou relies on &quot;law precedes + setting-contradiction self-check&quot; to institutionally prevent retcons.</p><p>The root of preventing such retcons is law precedence: new content all appendix-caliber incremental joins; early iron laws are not overturned for plot needs. Path D · human-engineered Dao-Law soul rings&#39; setting is written into the law from the start; Lin Hao&#39;s rise always stays within law, never relying on temporary word changes of &quot;the rules are actually like this.&quot; The setting-contradiction self-check table is periodically audited; once a Tang-San-style &quot;overturn early to level&quot; is found, it is immediately flagged and corrected.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate the Dou early iron-law list and their late overturn timepoints</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A maintain retcons; Group B inject law-precedence constraint</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: setting-credibility decay curve over chapters</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: output &quot;Dou Retcon Event List and Credit-Loss Quantification&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: low</strong>. Multiple early iron laws overturned late; early and late cannot coexist</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extreme (this series&#39; #1 negative textbook)</strong>. Sequel crossover further stacks contradictions</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high</strong></li></ul><p>Retcon-ending&#39;s root is not the author&#39;s pen power, but law not preceding. Early-laid iron laws, once they become plot stumbling blocks, are casually kicked aside. Dou&#39;s problem is: its iron laws were never constants from the start, but functions of the protagonist&#39;s height — the protagonist grows an inch, rules retreat a foot.</p><p>Retcon-ending is also horrifying because it is &quot;contagious.&quot; Once the author discovers &quot;retcons can solve plot problems,&quot; they use it repeatedly, forming path dependence. Early Dou still barely kept rules; late treats retcon as a regular tool. Setting sinks from &quot;must obey&quot; to &quot;changeable anytime&quot;; the trust contract between author and readers breaks — this hurts the worldview more than any single contradiction.</p><p>Retcon-ending in Dou also has a concrete manifestation: the scarcity of early &quot;century rings scarce&quot; was built by the protagonist&#39;s group hunting through near-death. Readers tense up with them precisely because this thing is hard to get. Late hundred-thousand-year rings and spirit souls are casually obtainable; that year&#39;s tension becomes a joke. Setting credit is thus worn away bit by bit by &quot;giving too easily.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou preserves scarcity via law precedence — good things are good things, not casually handed to whoever plot needs.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: early effort and foreshadowing voided late</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: protagonist solely enjoys rule-breaking leap benefits</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s internal rules have no obvious retcon yet; Dou is a severe case of retcon-ending</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: fickle rules first leave Myriad Ranks with no interpretation rights disoriented</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: a worldview extended by retcons cannot keep credit with multiversal civilization</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>A retcon is not a typo, but a structural disease. Heng Yuan Zhou sees clearly: law not preceding, long-form writing must retcon; Dou, with twenty realms and countless patches, proves the dead end of &quot;plot kidnaps setting&quot; cannot reach an end.</p><p>In the final analysis, Dou Continent · retcon-ending deep analysis · late setting overturning early described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./369_模块2-斗罗-剧情绑架设定案例-为剧情强行升级的典型.html">Entry 369 · Plot-Kidnaps-Setting Case</a> · <a href="./386_模块2-斗罗-法则优先对照-衡元宙如何避免吃书烂尾.html">Entry 386 · Law-First Comparison</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
